**导出面（节选）**，完整范围是 [src/editor.rs:L74-L131](https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/blob/a7d74150ac7a663fdaa01ec5177e303baaf6c331/crates/editor/src/editor.rs#L74-L131)。几处值得精读：

